{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57889","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57889","key":"SV-11395","fields":{"summary":"Board View – Avatar Name Bubble Opens Below the Avatars Instead of Above","parent":{"id":"56390","key":"SV-10046","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56390","fields":{"summary":"Board View — board by lead technician","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}},"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62399","id":"62399","filename":"D-DESIGN-13-name-bubble-below.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-15T08:06:28.934-0500","size":19225,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62399","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62399"}],"description":"h2. Description\n\n*Hovering a technician's avatar on a card should show a small dark bubble with the name above the avatar.* On staging it opens below.\n\nFor example,\n\n* the name bubble shows the technician's name\n* it opens below the avatars, not above them\n\nThis appears inconsistent with the requirement defined in *Epic SV-10043* (Story *SV-10046*), the PRD and the design.\n\nh2. Steps to Reproduce\n\n# Sign in to staging as an Admin, check the top bar shows *Staging Heavy Duty - 9919*, and use a browser window 1440 px wide at 100% zoom.\n# Open *Work Orders*, click the *All* tab, then *Board View* in the display switcher (right side of the toolbar).\n# Rest the pointer on a technician avatar on any card.\n#* The dark name bubble opens below the avatar.\n\n*Actual Result:*\n\n* The name bubble opens below the avatar.\n\n*Expected Result:*\n\n* The bubble opens above the avatar, as the test expects: *\"Step 6: the same small dark bubble shows {Technician-A}'s name above the avatar.\"*\n\n!D-DESIGN-13-name-bubble-below.png|width=542,height=268!\n\nh2. Environment\n\n* *Build:* {{v26.40.17-a5c4210}} on [staging|https://app.staging.shopview.com/workorders] (Staging Heavy Duty - 9919), 15 Oct 2026\n* *User:* Admin (on staging the Admin quick-login user), browser window 1440 px wide at 100% zoom\n\nh2. Sources\n\n* [PRD – Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (page 845185030, version 52, 14 Oct 2026, as quoted by the test case), S2-R10 and S7-R2:\nHovering a technician header or avatar reveals the technician’s name.\nUse each visible avatar’s own visible area as its hover target.\n* Test case C590124 (Expected, verbatim):\nStep 3: a small dark bubble with light text shows {Technician-A}'s name above the avatar, as in the avatar-hover design picture.\nStep 6: the same small dark bubble shows {Technician-A}'s name above the avatar.\n* Design reference — Claude Design project \"Work Orders\" (Branko Cicovic), export of 14 Oct 2026, board \"Work Orders.dc.html\" (as the test cases give it) — _ds_bundle.js (design library), avatar group name bubble:\nbottom: 'calc(100% + 6px)',\n\nh2. Test case\n\n* [C590124 Hover turns a row light grey, darkens a card border and shows dark name bubbles|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590124]","issuelinks":[{"id":"33574","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33574","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"56390","key":"SV-10046","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56390","fields":{"summary":"Board View — board by lead technician","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}}}],"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57889/comment/78877","id":"78877","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb] valid. Avatar name bubbles open above the avatar in both views, as in the design (PRD v60). Please fold it into PR (a). [~accountid:712020:b2d16ade-9013-4875-8a9d-e255e63e8217] [~accountid:712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e] for QA: test against [PRD v60|https://shopview.atlass